{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Southbound</strong> is an open-world survival roguelite set in a mysterious land at the edge of the southern world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A thousand years after civilization collapsed, nature has reclaimed the frontier. Forests cover forgotten roads, mountains hide abandoned settlements, and only a few explorers still dare to travel the wild lands beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But something is wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange creatures roam the valleys, the landscape behaves in unsettling ways, and rumors speak of a <strong>fracture far to the south</strong> where reality itself seems to be breaking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt monsters, gather power-ups, and grow stronger as you explore a vast and unpredictable wilderness. Survive as long as you can and push further south with every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The further south you go, the stranger the world becomes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across a vast wilderness inspired by South American landscapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through multiple biomes as the terrain shifts from forests and mountains to distant southern lands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781420/extras/5edc820dd5d6c1d40fb5119e7805b88a.poster.avif?t=1773430637\" width=1170 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781420/extras/5edc820dd5d6c1d40fb5119e7805b88a.webm?t=1773430637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781420/extras/5edc820dd5d6c1d40fb5119e7805b88a.mp4?t=1773430637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidde